    "summary": "Untrammelled Ferocity applies on a Fall Back move, an Advance move or a Normal move. The unit can cross sections of terrain up to 4″ tall and can pass within enemy Engagement Range. It must finish clear of enemy Engagement Range. Crossing a terrain section taller than 4″ calls for a D6 after moving. A 1 makes the unit Battle-shocked.",
